# M002 constraint policy, reviewed 2026-10-15.
# Actual board clocks are generated by the board/IP design:
#   core_clk = 100 MHz (10 ns); DDR0/DDR1 UI = 200 MHz (5 ns).
# board_clock_domains.xdc and build_vcu118_board.tcl audit those clocks.
# This file adds no timing exceptions, derates, LOCs or Pblocks.
# The previous reset-name multicycles and guessed placement had no protocol or
# current-device evidence. A future physical change requires fresh path evidence
# and a separately reviewed constraint; loading this file proves no timing gain.
